OL,3,ACharlie Kirk murder suspect pleads not
OL,4,Aguilty as judge clears way for death
OL,5,Apenalty trial
OL,6,
OL,7,FDefence lawyers had tried to have the
OL,8,Fdeath penalty taken off the table, but
OL,9,Fprosecutors argued that aggravating
OL,10,Ffactors, such as firing into a crowd in
OL,11,Fthe presence of children, warranted a
OL,12,Fcapital trial.
OL,14,FTurning Point USA co-founder Kirk, 31,
OL,15,Fwas shot in the neck while speaking at
OL,16,FUtah Valley University in Orem.
